    "description": {
      "value": "<p>以一个附赠动作，你可以对距你30尺内的一名可见自愿生物挥舞这张卡片，赋予该生物对未来的瞬间洞察。直到你的下一个回合开始，该生物在攻击检定、属性检定和豁免检定上具有优势。此外，其他生物在持续时间内对该目标的攻击检定具有劣势。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</p><p>As a bonus action, you can brandish this card at one willing creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself, granting the creature a brief glimpse of the future. Until the start of your next turn, the creature has advantage on attack rolls, ability checks, and saving throws. Additionally, other creatures have disadvantage on attack rolls against the target for the duration. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
